  "purpose": "Declared enforcement state for every GitHub-reachable controlled channel of Wheeler Hubbell Publishing. Decision Integrity is reflexive: the administrative controls that enforce examination are themselves part of the examined state. scripts/audit_enforcement.py compares the live GitHub administrative surface against this spec and treats any divergence as an unexamined transition. Changes to this file are themselves releases: they pass through the conformance gate on this repo.",
